The site header search opens the same search overlay as the workspace header, and Cmd/Ctrl+K opens it on every page. The overlay renders a "Show all results" link at the bottom that opens the full results page with the current term, scope and filters; Enter no longer leaves the overlay. The arrow keys move between the input, the results and that link. With an external search URL or without Solr, the site header keeps its inline search input. @danalvrz
